#. おうっ、苗木っち！
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh, Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クン…？
#. じゃあ、ボクの部屋にあった手紙って…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hiro...? Then the letter I found in my room..."
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、俺が書いたんよ。
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Yup, I wrote it."
msgstr ""

#. 意外に達筆なんだね…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Your handwriting is...really nice."
msgstr ""

#. 汚い字を書くと呪われんべ。
#. そう教わってきたんだ。
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well, I was always taught that if you had bad\n"
"penmanship, a ghost would come and haunt you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…誰にだよ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Who taught you that?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …それで、ボクに何か用なの？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And why did you want to meet with me?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は霧切っちに頼まれただけだべ。
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh, I just did what Kyoko asked me."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんに…？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko...?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺ってば、すっかりパシリな。
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I'm just an errand boy on this."
msgstr ""

#. それはそうと、今夜も風呂なんていかが？
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Anyway, whaddya say to a late-night bath session?"
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. よし、行くべ！
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Okay, let's do it!"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…ボクは…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, I..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンは困惑するボクの肩を引き寄せ、
#. 耳元で小声で呟いた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I was totally lost. Hiro grabbed me by the shoulder,\n"
"pulled me close, and whispered into my ear...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕に気付かれねー為の芝居だって…
#. みんな大浴場に集まってんだ…
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It's all an act, so the mastermind won't notice.\n"
"Everyone's waiting in the bathhouse."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなが大浴場に…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ひょっとして、
#. アルターエゴの調査が終わったとか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then...did Alter Ego finish his search...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …わかったよ、葉隠クン！
#. 一緒にお風呂に入ろっか！！
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-You got it, Hiro! Let's go take a dip together!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>わざとらしく大声で、
#. そんな事を宣言した後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I was probably louder than I needed to be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクと葉隠クンは、脱衣所へと急いだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But me and Hiro hurried to the dressing room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
